          m_Value1: 17481646120402359005
        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: 'Specifies an amount of seconds to wait

          in between each
          attack. Typically useful

          to have at least a 1 second of a cooldown

          to
          allow the Ability charge prompt to

          properly debuild when using
          an ability

          that has a warning and attack duration

          of
          0. (Such as during a SummonBackup

          ability)'
